                <pb facs="0460" n="378" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg378"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commanding General of the
                            Department of Texas to the Adjutant
                            General.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Antonio, Tex.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-12-18"><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Information from officials Presidio, Tex., advises that force of customs
                    inspectors and State rangers sufficient to handle situation in that
                    vicinity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hoyt</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
